msgid "Remove application \"%1$s\" from the map?"
msgstr "Fjern applikationen \"%1$s\" fra kortet?"

msgid "Remove service \"%1$s\" from the map?"
msgstr "Fjern tjenesten \"%1$s\" fra kortet?"

msgid "Its services, databases and external calls leave the map. Services shared with other applications stay."
msgstr "Dens tjenester, databaser og eksterne kald forlader kortet. Tjenester, der deles med andre applikationer, bliver."

msgid "The service, its connections, databases and external calls leave the map."
msgstr "Tjenesten, dens forbindelser, databaser og eksterne kald forlader kortet."

msgid "If the application is discovered again in new traces, it is recreated automatically, with all its entities."
msgstr "Hvis applikationen opdages igen i nye traces, genskabes den automatisk med alle dens enheder."

msgid "If the service is discovered again in new traces, it is recreated automatically, with all its entities."
msgstr "Hvis tjenesten opdages igen i nye traces, genskabes den automatisk med alle dens enheder."

msgid "Hosts, items and triggers in Zabbix are not changed."
msgstr "Hosts, elementer og triggere i Zabbix ændres ikke."

msgid "Remove %1$s"
msgstr "Fjern %1$s"

msgid "No data found"
msgstr "Ingen data fundet"

msgid "No APM span matches the attribute filter in the selected time range. Change the filter above or press Reset to see everything."
msgstr "Ingen APM-spans matcher attributfilteret i det valgte tidsinterval. Ret filteret ovenfor, eller tryk på Nulstil for at se alt."

msgid "No APM traces in the selected time range and no host with the apm.requests item. Services appear here as soon as the applications send traces to the Zabbix proxy."
msgstr "Ingen APM-traces i det valgte tidsinterval og ingen host med elementet apm.requests. Tjenester vises her, så snart applikationerne sender traces til Zabbix-proxyen."

